## Preventative maintenance services

A PM interval is a scheduled look at the systems that fail expensively. We
provide:

- Tire inspections and rotations
- Brake system inspections and adjustments
- Transmission fluid checks and replacements
- Steering and suspension checks
- Battery inspections and replacements
- Air filter replacements
- Lubrication of key components

## Why it is worth the bay time

Preventative maintenance is the difference between a part replaced on a schedule
you chose and a part replaced on one the truck chose. Inspecting and servicing
the critical components on an interval catches small problems while they are
still small, which is what keeps downtime and repair cost down and the equipment
in service longer.

The right interval is a question about the work, not the calendar: mileage,
load, and the roads the truck runs decide it. Bring us the duty cycle and we
will set one against it.

